window.products.push({"id":282049,"name":"Kaleurrier Gas Lift Cylinder,Pneumatic Chair Replacement Parts- Chair or Stool Lifting Control Mechanism, 500 lbs Heavy Duty Steel Case,Chromcraft,in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ogC-GaaNL._AC_SL1082_.jpg","description":"Kaleurrier gas lift cylinder is high quality,sturdy and durable,gas pressure stable,in UNIVERSAL size which fits most office chairs, task chairs, executive chairs,office stools,spa & salon stools,etc.Its longer stroke fits users of varying heights. SPECIFICATIONS: * Outer steel:2\" diameter for body,1.57\" for bottom.Fits 2\" diameter centre hole base  * Inner Shaft:1.1\" diameter.Fits 1.1\" seat plate hole(control mechanism) *Minimum length: 9.5 inches *Maximum length when fully extended: 13.5 inches *Stroke(adjustable height range): 4 inches QUESTIONS: ANSWERS: 1.How to choose a suitable gas lift cylinder? Firstly,quality is very important for pneumatic products.Kaleurrier gas lift cylinder has been passed official SGS tests and certification,meet ANSI/BIFMA X5.1 & EN 1335 General-Purpose Office Chairs standard,used high quality materials,to make sure it works smoothly,be safe during use,explosion-proof. Secondly,Our gas lift in standard size fits most office chairs,task chairs, executive chairs,office stools,spa & salon stools.But it is important to measure dimensions before you purchase it,to make sure that you get the right size. 2.How to replace the damaged gas lift with a new one ? Please refer to the tips on the photo or search a video in Youtube. 3.If the cylinder does not fit my chair or stool,or does not work, what shouldl I do?Or have more questions? Please contact with us - click “contact seller” first.We will give you a proper solution in 12 hours. We’d love to hear from you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ogC-GaaNL._AC_SL1082_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kaleurrier","source_asin":"B07TYJJ2F2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TYJJ2F2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TYJJ2F2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
