window.products.push({"id":282083,"name":"SINKUG Torch Lighter, Butane Torch Lighters Refillable with Safety Lock, Mini Cooking Torch Dab Torch with Continuous Flame for Creme Brulee,Searing,W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718R4rnA9UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plastic material is durable and light. Stainless steel has fire resistance, heat resistance. It can resist scaling and maintain strength at high temperature. It can be used in harsh environment. 【Adjustable Continuously Flame】Just press the ignition button and slide the safety lock to left,the torch lighter can create a continuous flame.No need to keep pressing. Butane torch built with regulator to adjust the size of flame (bigger or smaller) and the regulator is in the reach of your thumb, enabling you to easily adjust and lock. 【Safety & Easy Operate】Coming with a safety lock.Please slide the safety lock to left to prevent accidental opening.The long angled nozzle and burn-free finger guard protects you from burns. We increased the weight of the bottom of the torch.The base is stable now, which can avoid falling down and causing gas leakage. 【360°Rotation & Refillable】Butane torch lighters for using at any angle. The fire wouldn't spread when rotating it for 360 degree.With a long nozzle, you can effortlessly refill the butane lighter with butane.( Butane Gas Isn't Included ) 【Versatile Kitchen Torch】This blow torch is a portable & mini torch for making crème Brulee, searing meat, toasting marshmallows, charring peppers, jewelry soldering,BBQ,dabs,craft, DIY and stove. 【Cooking Torch with Guarantee】This butane torch lighter is also a great gift for Wedding, Housewarming and other celebrations. We are confident that our high-grade torch will bring you perfect cooking experience. If you have any questions during use, we would be glad to help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718R4rnA9UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SINKUG","source_asin":"B09N3G2SGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N3G2SGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N3G2SGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":282084,"name":"Luxury Acrylic Cotton Pad Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xfpVw2wnL.jpg","description":"[Regarding Acrylic] Acrylic is a useful, clear plastic that resembles glass. But it has properties that make it superior to glass in many ways. It is many times stronger than glass, making it much more impact resistant and therefore safer. Acrylic also insulates better than glass, potentially saving on heating bills. Adding to this favorable array of properties, a transparency rate of 93% makes acrylic the clearest material known. Very thick glass will have a green tint, while acrylic remains clear. Note : 1,Although it has a hard and clear surface, please avoid sharp scratch to keep its aesthetic. 2,Acrylic also insulates better than glass or plastic, but please don't close to the source of ignition to avoid damaging. 3,Cosmetic organizer isn't the Anti-Pressure product, please don't place too heavy articles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xfpVw2wnL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beauty Acrylic","source_asin":"B0189NT474","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0189NT474","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0189NT474","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
