window.products.push({"id":282185,"name":"Basic Beyond Chair Cushions for Dining Chairs 4 Pack, Memory Foam Chair Cushion with Ties and Non Slip Backing, 16 x 16 inches Chair Pads for Dining C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YoPFjsI0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏘 MEMORY FOAM CHAIR PAD: Basic Beyond kitchen chair cushions set of 4, measure 16x16 inches with 2 inches thickness. The kitchen seat cushions are filled with an entire piece of memory foam which holds to the shape of your body for even weight distribution. Our chair pad is not only a great attachment to any hard wooden chairs, but a beautiful decoration to your room. 🏘 SLIP-RESISTANT DESIGN: Our seat cushions for kitchen chairs feature a slip resistant backing to keep chair pads not slipping when sat on. Besides, there are two ties at each chair pad to keep it securely in place on any chair when guests get in or out of chair. Our double safety anti-slipping design make our chair pad a great difference from others. If the seat cushion leaves the seat when you get up, there are still two ties strap it tightly to the chair. 🏘 FOR VARIOUS CHAIRS: The cover of our seat cushions for dining room chairs are made from durable textured yarn dyed fabric which is wear resistant but not professional waterproof. They can be used as outdoor cushions but don't forget to take them in when rain pours. It is highly recommended to keep them away from water or heavy rains for longer use. Besides, they are fit for living room, play room,bedroom, and it also will be a good companion when you are working. 🏘 BACK TO SHAPE: Our dining chair cushions with ties are packed in vacuum bags, but the memory foam has a very good resilience which makes kitchen chair pads return to their original shape quickly. Please allows 24-48 hours to fully expand, the more time you give them to recover, the better support they could provide. 🏘 EASY CARE: If the dining room chair cushions are stained or dirty, you'd better spot clean with damp cloth and hang them to dry. Do Not Bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YoPFjsI0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Basic Beyond","source_asin":"B0BN343X2B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN343X2B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN343X2B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
