window.products.push({"id":282235,"name":"Digital Wall Clock with Remote Control, 16\" Large Display Wall Clock, 10-Level Brightness Adjustment, Countdown Timer, Temperature and 12/24H, LED Dig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZyRHbplbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Digital Wall Clock with Remote Control】LFGKeng digital wall clock has a 16 Inch large display, , making it easy to view and read even from a distance. Except for time. Date, day of the week and temperature are also displayed at a glance. Its perfect for large spaces, such as gyms, shops, warehouses, garages or classrooms, offices, and your living room decor, kitchen, and even bedroom! 【Automatic light-sensing/manual adjustable brightness】Bedroom digital wall clock has 10-level adjustable brightness display, you can easily manually adjust to a comfortable brightness with the remote control, so that you have no disturbing glare in the bedroom and sleep. The large display can also automatically adjust the brightness as the light changes, so it wont be too bright at night. Also, you can turn it off if desired. 【 LED Digital Clock】Our wall led digital clock there is a built-in memory function, even if the power is disconnected, the time data will not be lost, no need to reset. In addition to normal display of time, temperature, date, day of the week and alarm, this wall mounted digital clock also has a countdown function, which is ideal for kitchen cooking, beauty, exercise, classroom teaching and childrens time management. 【EASY TO USE】Our modern digital wall clock has a power plug so you dont have to change the battery often, two key holes for easy wall mounting, and a 9.8FT power cord that gives you a long enough distance to connect the plug. Its easy to set up, and you can use the device or buttons on the remote to easily set the clock.Note: The digital wall clock only works on AC power.The power adapter is at both ends of the package, please pay attention to check! 【Worry free shopping experience】For all customers who have purchased our large display digital wall clock, we will provide friendly customer service and promise to do our best to solve your problem. If you have any questions about the product, please feel free to contact us via order information or email. We will get back to you within 24 hours.Thank you for your understanding and support!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZyRHbplbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LFGKeng","source_asin":"B09F916GXX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F916GXX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F916GXX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
