window.products.push({"id":282326,"name":"6-pack silicone Stretch Lids – Multiple Sizes Food-Grade Silicone Bowl Cover – Practical and User-Friendly – Ideal for Leftover Foods – Eco-Friendly –","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JyDnkgauL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Say goodbye to Saran Wrap! These silicone storage lips can be used repeatedly for more than two years and it's fixing force and elasticity are not reduced, you can use them over and over again! It is more environmentally friendly, more sealed and healthier than ordinary plastic wrap. The bowl stretch lids will reduce your plastic waste and help you save money. Silicone cover material is non-toxic, tasteless, high and low temperature. The temperature range is from -40 to +240 C. It can be used in the fridge, a microwave oven electric oven. Because of the excellent elasticity of silica gel, when the container is covered, an internal negative pressure state is formed, which completely isolates the internal and external gas flow, and the sealing performance is unmatched. Used in the fridge to cover bowls, pans, pots and so on, will never smell, because completely isolated air entry, can achieve the best preservation effect.Silicone lids set came with 6 lids at different sizes and the lids were stretchable so they pretty much covered all of the bowls in your kitchen. These seem like they will be great for reducing our single-use plastic consumption, specifically plastic cling wrap.  (1) 2.64\" (can stretches to 3.5\")  (2) 3.66\" (can stretches to 5\")  (3) 4.33\" (can stretches to 6\")(4) 5.51\" (can stretches to 8\")  (5) 6.3\" (can stretches to 9\")  (6) 8.07\" (can stretches to 11\") Tips for Use: 1.Please wash the lids before the first time using and after each use, you should wash them with the soft tool. 2.Dry lids seal better than wet. 3.Don't completely seal the container when using in the microwave oven. 4.The stretch lids can fit many kinds of container whether round, square, rectangular, etc. But they may not be sealed when you use in the linear products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JyDnkgauL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"tazzpluz","source_asin":"B07HKTKZTJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HKTKZTJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HKTKZTJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
