window.products.push({"id":282350,"name":"MUMSUNG Empanadas Press, 4inch Dumpling Maker With Dough Cutter,Dumpling Mold Set (L/4\"-Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KFGrpirlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FASTER MAKING PROCESS - MUMSUNG empanadas press kit includes 1 large dumpling mold 1 dough press cutter and 1 stuffing spoon. You can use this kitchen gadget to make perfectly Dumplings or Empanadas in 30 seconds with not one leak. It sure beats using a fork! Using our pierogi maker press will skip the step of moistening the edges of the wrapper with water! EASY TO USE - Cut a dough slice, Place your dough on the press, add your filling, flip it closed and press down, and DONE! Even beginners or kids can easily use this multiuse dumpling mold set to make a lot of amazing Chinese dumplings, empanadas, Jamaican Beef Patties, pierogi, ravioli, samosa, gyoza, wonton, calzone, mini pie, wrapper, turnover, potstickers, and many more. They are amazing kitchen tools that make cooking simple and easy for you without special skills and extra practice. NICE TIGHT SEAL - MUMSUNG dumplings press has a unique deep crinkles design that gives the dumplings a prettier and finer edge pattern and makes sure the dough seals tight so that the filling won't leak and the dumpling won't open while baking, frying or boiling. These dough press kits also work very well using the store-bought dough but need to fit the correct size. PROFESSIONAL DUMPLING MAKER - MUMSUNG multiuse calzone maker mold has a deeper belly to hold more filling than others in the same size, and an integrated edge cutter will cut off excess dumpling edge dough. You will get a lot of identical, amazing, professional-looking, perfect dumplings. This cool cooking gadget is a perfect gift for the chef in your life. FOOD-GRADE MATERIAL and EASY TO CLEAN - The empanada press is made of thickened food-grade plastic, BPA-free, drop-resistant, and durable. Dough cutters and spoons are made of food-grade 304 stainless steel and won't rust. All of those are easy to clean and dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KFGrpirlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUMSUNG","source_asin":"B0C2Z5N4DJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2Z5N4DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2Z5N4DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":282351,"name":"TAIGUJI Small Pet Scale for cat and Dog, Electronic Puppy Scales Kitchen Scale, Tray Portable Digital Scale for Small pet Hatching and Food Weighing, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WjxblnJxL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Q: How big is your pet?Answer: The tray is 11.61*8.11*2.28 in, suitable only for small pets whose length does not exceed 11.61 in. If you need to increase the weight of your pet up to 22 lb , please add another container, just clear the weight of the containerQ: Can I measure the weight of a large pet?Answer: Not very suitable. If the weight does not exceed 22 lb, place it in the corresponding container and weigh it.(The puppy in the picture is basically the largest pet that can be weighed without other containers.This scale is very sensitive to changes in weight. Please comfort your pet and keep him from moving as much as possible when weighing.)Q: Can it be used as a kitchen scale?Answer: Yes, this model has been upgraded to a 22 lb range based on a 11 lb kitchen scale. it can also be used as a normal kitchen scale.The digital scale has a built-in precise load sensor and is equipped with 4 precision units (g/lb:oz/oz/ml) . Make you weigh nuts and grains with amazing accuracy , Fruits, etc. to achieve precise portion control and healthier cooking.lls, medicines.Q: Can it be used as a baby scale?Answer: No, the baby scale requires a tray length of about 31 in. This section is 11.61 in.Q: Will the tray drop?Answer: There are 4 locating posts and 2 sponge adhesives on the bottom of the tray, there is no drop of the tray after assembly. For assembly, follow the instructions in the manual, aligning the four holes, peeling the two double-sided adhesive separator plates, and pressing firmly on the tray and base. See the instructions for more information. Assembly is very easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WjxblnJxL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEE STUNG LIPS","source_asin":"B08Y7KB91J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y7KB91J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y7KB91J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":282352,"name":"Surborder Shop Creative Twin Bell Analog Alarm Clock Battery Operated - Loud Alarm Clock 4\" Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kqBdZaCIL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Twin Bell Analog Alarm Clock Classic twin bell alarm clock, this vintage style takes you back to 80's. Loud Alarm Clock and No Snooze Alarm Clock Loud alarm ringing for people who are heavy sleepers, mild loss hearing  No snooze button, it can only be turned off by flipping a switch in the back, good wake up clock for people who has trouble waking up.  Alarm Clock Battery Operated Tips Please select the appropriate battery and read the manual carefully before use. Fitting The knob of Alarm clock is design for coupled way, it is loose. The battery compartment is designed for easy installment and replacement.  1* Analog Alarm Clock  1* Manual 1 AA 1.5V battery required (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kqBdZaCIL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Surborder Shop","source_asin":"B01BTSFE5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BTSFE5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BTSFE5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":282353,"name":"LAST CONFECTION 3-Piece Round Cake Pan Set - Includes 4\", 6\" and 8\" Aluminum Pans 2\" Deep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wHKA8e00L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 piece set includes: 4\" x 2\", 6\" x 2\" and 8\" x 2\" Cake Pans Superior heat distribution: Extra thick, seamless even-wall construction creates superb heat distribution for your batter ensuring your cake rises both level and flat. These professional-quality cake pans retain even baking temperatures preventing overbaking or gummy centers. Free of extra metals, welds and chemical coatings, these cake pans cool quickly to enjoy delicious and flawless results every time you bake. Non-reactive anodized aluminum: Perfect for cake batters containing acidic ingredients such as vinegar, lemon juice, chocolate, buttermilk, coffee, brown sugar, fruits and vegetables. Anodizing creates a nonreactive surface which prevents any discoloration and protects the flavor of your baked goods. Straight-sided design: Creates right angle edges on your cakes for uniform slices and perfect layer cakes. Makes frosting around the sides a breeze with uniform coverage. With the straight-sided design, these cake pans can take the place of many specialty baking pans. Bake dense, heavy cakes such as cheesecake or carrot cake, light and airy layer cakes, or even get creative with deep dish pizza, flan and gelatin molded desserts, with these multi-purpose pans. Easy to clean: Forget about scrubbing baked-on foods, save time and effort with these cake pans that wipe clean quickly with warm water and mild dish detergent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wHKA8e00L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAST CONFECTION","source_asin":"B09PLKH1GL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PLKH1GL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PLKH1GL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
