window.products.push({"id":282539,"name":"Bonzy Home Shoe Rack For Entryway, 5-Tier Shoe Shelf with Umbrella Holder and Fabric Pockets, Metal Mesh, Flat & Slant Adjustable Free Standing Shoe R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ri0VOxfpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MULTI-FUNCTION SHOES RACK】Our upgraded shoe shelf has such a big storage ability for your daily essentials. It is added with an Umbrella Holder and 6 Fabric Pockets. Both of them could exchange positions on either side to meet your needs. Moreover, a removable raincatcher plate is also a companion. 【LARGE CAPACITY SHOE STAND】Size: 40”L x 12”W x 36.2”H. It is wide enough to holds up to 21 pairs of shoes. The variety-height layer makes it’s able to store boots, high heels, sneakers, slippers, kid shoes, flats. Such an ideal space-saving solution in your entryway, hallway, closet, living room, bedroom, garage, etc. 【ALL-METAL SHELVES】The shoe racks are constructed with high-quality particleboard and metal mesh shelves, providing long-lasting performance and strength even though heavy items are put on. The top plate supports up to 66 lb and the shelf supports up to 44 lb. No aging, no bowing is exactly what you expect. 【NO WORRIES ABOUT HEELS】Some large gaps of some shoe holder are unable to put the high heels on? Our shoe storage designed with the intensive metal mesh, the precise grid prevents even the small items from falling down and keep your stilettos, boots, shoes and high heels shoes stable. 【FLAT/TILTED ADJUSTABLE】With precisely pre-drilled holes on the side frames, 4-tiered steel mesh shelves which can be either flat or slanted to adjust at a proper position according to you using habits. The rising lip of each prevents the shoes sliding off if you assemble it angled.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ri0VOxfpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonzy Home","source_asin":"B0BCPKWCP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCPKWCP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCPKWCP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
