window.products.push({"id":282658,"name":"Gold/Tall Candle Holders Wedding Centerpieces for Tables,(50cm/19.7\" H) Flower Holder 2pcs Vases for Centerpieces Flower Stand and Wedding Table Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HGkKi3r9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【PACKAGE INCLUDES】» 2pcs × Table centerpieces and 1pcs x Assemble instruction. (19.7\"/50cm H) and the base diameter is 4.92\"/12.5cm. Candles and artificial flowers are not included. It will reflect different colors in different lights. Light gold, rose gold, gold Very interesting. There is a bearing block on the bottom of the tall wedding centerpieces to make the metal flower holder more sturdy. ✔【MULTIFUNCTIONAL】» You may put an artificial flower ball on top of the flower stands as wedding vases for weddings or other special days. You may put scented candles on top of the candle stand as candlestick holders. It is also a good choice for restaurant hotels to create romantic Centros de mesa when you put a led tealight holder on it. It is an extremely elegant centerpiece for the table even there are no fake flowers or candles on it. ✔【ELEGANT DESIGN】» Our candelabra centerpieces especially gold vases for centerpieces are made of zinc alloy which is anti-rust. Simple and elegant mermaid design centerpieces for the dining tables make tables more attractive and elegant. ✔【ROMANTIC GIFTS】» Gold centerpieces for weddings/parties. great ornaments for a birthday, candlelight dinner, dining room, wedding table centerpiece, living room, parlor, study, bar, and other festival decoration, please use a soft cloth to clean the centerpiece vases. ✔【ASSEMBLY NEEDED】» These large candle holders for the wedding centerpiece stand are made from a few different segments. The installation of the gold wedding centerpieces is very easy and interesting for DIY. You can install it from our Assemble Instruction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HGkKi3r9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mercijzyasang","source_asin":"B098JP6S85","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098JP6S85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098JP6S85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
