window.products.push({"id":282662,"name":"Oiijjur 4pcs Faux Pampas Grass Tall 43” / 3.6ft, Non-Shedding Large Artificial Fluffy Reed Fake Flower Feather Arrangement for Floor Vase Filler Boho ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71THZ6u6-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Adjustable Length and Branches】 We make a special design for these pampas grass , you will get 3 kinds of length with different installation methods but without bending. The first one is 43” bouquet with 4 stems, 18 branches/ stem. The second one is 37.8” bouquet with 6 stems, 12 branches/ stem. The last one is 17” bouquet with 12 stems, 6 branches/ stem. This unique design is for fit the vases of different height. 【Packing Without Bending】 In order to give you a better shopping experience and keep the products fluffy and straight, we separate a big pampas grass to 4 parts, so you willl get 12pcs plume stems, 6pcs smooth stems (extra 2pcs smooth stems for you to change the height of the products), can be assembled in your style. 【No Shedding And Daily Maintenance Needless】Unlike the dried pampas grass, natural reed or fresh flowers, our silk reed grasses will not shed, no stench smell, do not need water and daily maintenance. 【Special Color】We mix the grey and navy blue , that looks more variety and you can also arrange them separately. And the light brown color is more close to the color of natural pompas grass than the beige. They are great kitchen,dining room, bedroom, living room, office, hotel, rustic room, boho party summer fall wedding decor decoration and photo props, and also a great housewarming gift. 【Material】 The feather plumes are made of polyester fiber, the stems are made of iron wire wrapped in rustic paper, so it can be bend if the stems are too long for your vase. 【Warm Tips】 Vase is not included in this product. And the pampas is hand crafted, may be a little difference between two of them. The color might look different to you in pictures, it depends on the different lighting, but not big difference. If you have any issues please feel free to contact us. Your satisfaction is our great comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71THZ6u6-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oiijjur","source_asin":"B0B1J9BDMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-282662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1J9BDMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1J9BDMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
